Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:23.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,Net, minus {\c&H1EB0F2&}ninety{\c&HFAF7F5&}\Ndollars. Win rate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.53,0:00:26.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,doesn't pay you. The\N{\c&H1EB0F2&}size{\c&HFAF7F5&} of your wins and
